- [JEP 469: Vector API (Eighth Incubator)（向量 API，第八次孵化）](https://openjdk.org/jeps/469)
- [JEP 473: Stream Gatherers (Second Preview)（流收集器，第二次预览）](https://openjdk.org/jeps/473)
